WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.720
Having trouble syncing your
OneDrive?

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.640
Here's how to help by unlinking
and then relinking your account.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.102
Don't worry, you won't lose any
of your files or photos this

4
00:00:11.102 --> 00:00:11.280
way.

5
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.280
We're just going to reconnect
your OneDrive.

6
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:18.891
First, select the OneDrive icon
on your taskbar, then select

7
00:00:18.891 --> 00:00:19.560
Settings.

8
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.592
On the Accounts tab, select
Unlink This PC, then confirm by

9
00:00:27.592 --> 00:00:29.600
selecting Unlink Accounts.

10
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.200
After you unlink, a setup box
will appear.

11
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.000
When prompted, sign into your
OneDrive.

12
00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.058
Here, OneDrive will ask where
you'd like your files to be

13
00:00:41.058 --> 00:00:41.360
stored.

14
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.753
Since we're linking the same
account back again, select Next,

15
00:00:45.753 --> 00:00:47.120
then use this folder.

16
00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.736
Now OneDrive will start to
backup your files so they are

17
00:00:52.736 --> 00:00:54.440
protected and available
anywhere.

18
00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.274
Select Next, then click through
the next few screens as they

19
00:00:58.274 --> 00:01:00.000
remind you how to use OneDrive.

20
00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:09.652
You can even download the
OneDrive mobile app for iOS or

21
00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:11.940
Android, or select later to
continue.

22
00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:15.340
Now OneDrive will begin to
resync your files.

23
00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:20.680
You can view your sync status by
opening your OneDrive folder or

24
00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:24.300
by selecting the OneDrive icon
on your taskbar.

25
00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:28.262
Full file syncing might take up
to an hour depending on your

26
00:01:28.262 --> 00:01:29.060
Internet speed.

27
00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.160
Once your OneDrive is relinked
and synced, you're good to go.
